<section class="section sponsor-section" id="sponsor-kennel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div class="kicker">Support an animal · Sponsor a Kennel</div>
      <h2>Sponsor a Kennel — Only R200 a Month</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Your monthly sponsorship helps provide food, bedding, cleaning, basic
        care and daily kennel expenses. Help us keep a safe space available for
        the next animal in need.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="poster-card">
        <img
          alt="Tshwane SPCA Sponsor a Kennel poster: R200 per month, 18A certificate, sponsorship and banking details"
          class="poster sponsor-poster"
          decoding="async"
          loading="lazy"
          src="/assets/sponsor-a-kennel-preview.jpg"
        />
        <div class="poster-actions">
          <button data-view="sponsor" type="button">🔎 Enlarge poster</button
          ><a
            class="sponsor-save"
            download="sponsor-a-kennel-preview.jpg"
            href="/assets/sponsor-a-kennel-preview.jpg"
            >⬇ Save poster</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>💙 Give them somewhere safe to stay</h3>
        <p>
          For just <strong>R200 per month</strong>, you can support a kennel and
          the animals who depend on it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sponsors may receive a name board or plaque at the kennel as a token
          of appreciation. A Section 18A certificate can be issued.
        </p>
        <h3>Arrange your sponsorship</h3>
        <p>
          For a debit order or sponsorship enquiries, contact the Chairperson:
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/enquiries/sponsorship">Send a sponsorship enquiry</a>
        </p>
        <h3>Banking details</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Tshwane SPCA</strong><br />FNB · Cheque Account<br />Account:
          <strong>561 6000 7452</strong><br />Branch code:
          <strong>261550</strong><br />Reference: <strong>Kennels</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
